direction: right

# Left
config: |md
  ## Configuration approaches

  * Cool URIs
  * Caching aware approaches
  * Stable URLs (potential PIDs)
  * HTTP status codes:
    * 2xx for success
    * 3xx for redirects (e.g., 303 See Other)
    * 4xx for client errors
    * 5xx for server issues
  * Cache control headers
    * ETags / LastModified
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style: {
    fill: "#DBEAFE"
    stroke: "#2563EB"
    stroke-width: 2
    border-radius: 12
    font-color: "#1E3A8A"
  }
  width: 400
  height: 400
}

# Center
api: "Application\n Programming Interface\n (API or WebAPI)" {
  style: {
    fill: "#F5F3FF"
    stroke: "#7C3AED"
    stroke-width: 4
    border-radius: 16
    font-size: 16
    font-color: "#5B21B6"
    bold: true
  }
  width: 220
  height: 120
}

